insert into public.passages (id, subject_id, label, body_html, sort_order) values ('psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_05', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'Exploring Bali''s Natural Wonders', '<p>Exploring Bali''s Natural Wonders</p><p>Bali, a beautiful island in Indonesia, is known for its stunning landscapes and rich culture. While many come for the beaches and temples, the island also offers natural attractions that amaze nature lovers from around the world. From national parks and waterfalls to terraced rice fields, Bali is full of natural beauty.</p><p>In the west lies West Bali National Park, a peaceful area filled with green forests, calm mangrove swamps, and colorful coral reefs along the sea. The air is fresh, and the scenery feels untouched. One of the park’s most special sights is the Bali Starling—a rare white bird with bright blue around its eyes. Its soft song adds magic to the quiet forest. Visitors can walk along clear paths and enjoy the rich variety of plants and animals in this protected area.</p><p>Heading north, travelers find the scenic Munduk Waterfall, surrounded by green hills and forests. Water flows gently over rocky cliffs into a cool clear pool. Mist rises into the air, mixing with the calming sound of falling water. The walk to the waterfall passes through narrow paths lined with coffee and clove trees. Their fresh scent fills the air, offering a pleasant and peaceful experience. Munduk is the perfect place to relax and enjoy Bali’s natural charm.</p><p>Near the cultural center Ubud, the famous Tegalalang rice terraces stretch across the hills in green steps. These terraces are shaped by generations of farmers who work the land by hand. In the morning, mist rises above the fields, and sunlight reflects off the water in the paddies. Farmers in wide-brimmed hats plant rice carefully, their feet sinking into the soft earth. Water flows gently through small canals, keeping the fields healthy and green. The quiet surroundings and slow rhythm of farm life create a peaceful and inspiring scene.</p><p>These natural wonders highlight Bali''s dedication in preserving its environmental and cultural treasures. By exploring these sites, tourists not only experience the island''s scenic beauty but also support ongoing conservation efforts, helping to ensure that Bali''s wonders last for future generations.</p>', 4) on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, label = excluded.label, body_html = excluded.body_html, sort_order = excluded.sort_order;
insert into public.passages (id, subject_id, label, body_html, sort_order) values ('psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_06', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'My Experience as an Intern at a Sports Club', '<p>My Experience as an Intern at a Sports Club</p><p>Last summer, I had the opportunity to work as an intern at a local sports club. It was my first time working in a professional sports environment, and I was both nervous and excited. The internship went through a few phases, starting from orientation until finally jumping in to help during practices and games.</p><p>On my first day, I met the head coach, who welcomed me and explained my tasks. I had to set up cones for drills, bring water for the players, and check the training schedules. The first few days were challenging because I was not used to the morning routine. Every morning I had to wake up early, arrive on time, and follow instructions carefully. I worried about making mistakes, but the coaches were kind and guided me.</p><p>In the second month of my internship, I was trained to handle emergency situations. I got the chance to put that knowledge into practice when something unexpected happened. During football practice, a player fell and hurt his ankle. Everyone stopped, and I quickly ran to get the first aid kit. I helped the coach assess the injury and ensured the player stayed calm while we got him seated safely. Luckily, it wasn’t serious, but the experience reinforced an important lesson: staying alert and prepared during emergencies can make a big difference.</p><p>At the end of my internship, the coaches held an evaluation and reflection session where they shared the results of their feedback. They highlighted my strengths in teamwork, responsibility, and communication, and even gave me a club T-shirt as a gift. I felt proud because I had improved in these areas. It was a great experience, and</p><p>I hope to work in a sports club again in the future.</p>', 5) on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, label = excluded.label, body_html = excluded.body_html, sort_order = excluded.sort_order;
insert into public.passages (id, subject_id, label, body_html, sort_order) values ('psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_07', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'Teks untuk soal nomor 17 s.d. 20!', '<p><strong>Teks untuk soal nomor 17 s.d. 20!</strong></p><p><strong>Social Media Harms Teen Mental Health</strong></p><p>In today’s world, social media is a big part of many teenagers’ daily lives. While it has some benefits, such as staying connected with friends, meeting new people, and learning about interesting topics, it also brings serious problems. I strongly believe that social media harms teen mental health, and we must pay more attention to this issue before it becomes even worse.</p><p>First, social media often makes teenagers compare themselves to others in an unhealthy way. When teens see pictures of people who seem perfect, they feel that they are not good enough. These feelings can lower self-esteem and lead to sadness, anxiety, or even depression. The problem is that many of these online posts are edited, filtered, or fake, but teens still feel pressure to look or live the same way. They may think that their own life is boring or not successful, which is simply not true.</p><p>Second, too much time on social media affects sleep and study habits. Many teenagers use their phones late at night, checking messages or watching videos, which reduces sleep time and quality. Without enough sleep, teens cannot focus well in class, and their grades may suffer. This can increase stress and worry about the future, making them feel overwhelmed.</p><p>Finally, online bullying, or cyberbullying, is another serious danger. Unlike face-to-face bullying, it can happen at any time and be shared with many people. Victims of cyberbullying often feel alone, scared, and helpless, and in some cases, it leads to serious mental health problems.</p><p>In conclusion, although social media has some good uses, its harm to teen mental health is much greater. Teenagers need support from parents, teachers, and society to use it wisely. Schools should teach students how to use social media in healthy ways, and parents should guide their children to take breaks and spend time offline. By doing this, we can help protect young people’s mental health in this digital age.</p>', 6) on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, label = excluded.label, body_html = excluded.body_html, sort_order = excluded.sort_order;
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-001', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', 'single', 'Pemahaman Tekstual: mampu memahami informasi yang eksplisit, mengelompokkan, menyusun ulang, dan menyajikan kembali informasi eksplisit dari teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_01', '<p>Which of the following outlines shows the correct main points of the story?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>King Hung Vuong VI wanted the best husband for his daughter.</p><p>Many princes came but none was suitable.</p><p>Son Tinh and Thuy Tinh both wanted to marry her.</p><p>The King gave them a test.</p><p>Thuy Tinh arrived first with the wedding gifts.</p><p>The princess was given to Thuy Tinh.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>King Hung Vuong VI had a beautiful daughter.</p><p>He announced he was looking for the right husband.</p><p>Son Tinh and Thuy Tinh appeared and asked to marry her.</p><p>The King gave them a test with wedding gifts.</p><p>Son Tinh arrived first and married the princess.</p><p>Thuy Tinh attacked with floods but was defeated.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>King Hung Vuong VI asked his daughter to choose her husband.</p><p>The princess liked both Son Tinh and Thuy Tinh.</p><p>The King delayed his decision for many days.</p><p>Finally, he asked them to fight each other.</p><p>Thuy Tinh lost the battle and left the land.</p><p>The country never suffered from floods again.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>King Hung Vuong VI searched for a husband for his daughter.</p><p>Son Tinh and Thuy Tinh wanted to marry her.</p><p>The King gave them a challenge.</p><p>Thuy Tinh lost the test and became angry.</p><p>He called the waters to rise and destroy the land.</p><p>Son Tinh drowned in the floods.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>The King wanted a nobleman for his daughter.</p><p>He invited many princes to the palace.</p><p>Son Tinh and Thuy Tinh competed for the princess.</p><p>Son Tinh refused the challenge of gifts.</p><p>The King chose Thuy Tinh as the winner.</p><p>Thuy Tinh ruled peacefully without floods.</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'B', null, null, null, 'B') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-002', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'single', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_01', '<p>Why did Thuy Tinh attack Son Tinh after the wedding?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>He was jealous of Son Tinh’s victory</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>He believed the King had lied to him.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>He thought the princess loved him more.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>He wanted to show off his power to the king.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>He had promised to fight until death.</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'A', null, null, null, 'A') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-003', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-03', 'category', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_01', '<p>After reading the text, we can see that Son tinh and Thuy tinh are different, but they also have some similarities. Decide if each trait shows a <strong>similarity</strong> or a <strong>difference</strong>.</p>', null, null, null, null, '[{"key":"similarity","label":"Similarity"},{"key":"difference","label":"Difference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"A","text":"<p>Both are not humans.</p>","correctCategoryKey":"similarity"},{"id":"B","text":"<p>They can control the elements.</p>","correctCategoryKey":"similarity"},{"id":"C","text":"<p>They love the king''s daughter.</p>","correctCategoryKey":"difference"}]'::jsonb, 'Similarity A. Similarity B. Similarity C. Difference') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-004', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-03', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-04', 'single', 'Pengalaman inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_01', '<p>What does the phrase <em>“kept his promise”</em> in the text mean?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Forgot about his decision. </p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Changed his mind about the wedding.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Did what he had promised to do.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Delayed the marriage for many days.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>The King asked the princes to bring more gifts.</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'C', null, null, null, 'C') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-005', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-05', 'mcma', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks.', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_01', '<p>What is the main lesson of the story?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Accept defeat gracefully to prevent harm to others.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Be fair and follow the agreed rules in competitions.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Choose peaceful solutions rather than angry reactions.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Prepare honestly and present your gifts properly.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Respect leaders’ decisions and community agreements.</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','B']::text[], null, null, 'A, B') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-006', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-06', 'category', 'Pemahaman Tekstual: mampu memahami informasi yang eksplisit, mengelompokkan, menyusun ulang, dan menyajikan kembali informasi eksplisit dari teks.', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_02', '<p>The following activities are suggested in the infographic. Categorize them as either preparation or breaks during study.</p>', null, null, null, null, '[{"key":"preparation","label":"Preparation"},{"key":"breaks","label":"Breaks"}]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"A","text":"<p>Standing up</p>","correctCategoryKey":"breaks"},{"id":"B","text":"<p>Bringing a book</p>","correctCategoryKey":"preparation"},{"id":"C","text":"<p>Doing stretch</p>","correctCategoryKey":"breaks"}]'::jsonb, 'Activities A. Breaks B. Preparation C. Breaks') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-007', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', null, 'mcma', 'Pemahaman Tekstual: mampu memahami informasi yang eksplisit, mengelompokkan, menyusun ulang, dan menyajikan kembali informasi eksplisit dari teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_03', '<p>How can we decide a certain table is perfect for studying according to the text?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>It has good lighting</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>It provides white noise</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>It is located near the entrance</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>It is far from the toilet</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>It provides stationery</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','D']::text[], null, null, 'A,D') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-008', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', null, 'single', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_04', '<p>Who needs to read this infographic?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>The students of that school</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>People who happen to visit the school</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>The librarian of another school</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>The headmaster of that school</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Parents who come to pick up their kids</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'A', null, null, null, 'A') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-009', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-07', 'mcma', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: Mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks.', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_04', '<p>Which actions show disrespect for other students?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Speaking loudly to friends.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Keeping the phone silent.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Eating snacks at the desk.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Playing music in the corner.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Moving chairs noisily.</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','C','D','E']::text[], null, null, 'A, C, D, E') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-010', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-04', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-08', 'single', 'Evaluasi dan Apresiasi: Mampu membuat penilaian terhadap ide, menanggapi teks secara emosional dan estetis dengan mempertimbangkan dampaknya terhadap perasaan, imajinasi, serta penggunaan bahasa oleh penulis.', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_04', '<p>You find this infographic in front of your school library. What will you do before your next visit to the library?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Making sure that I bring my water bottle and lunch with me.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Bringing the books and stationery that I will use.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Organizing the book that I borrowed from the library.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Walking for five minutes so I can focus more when studying.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Making sure you look fresh because you will meet other students.</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'B', null, null, null, 'B') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-011', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-09', 'category', 'Pemahaman Tekstual: mampu memahami informasi yang eksplisit, mengelompokkan, menyusun ulang, dan menyajikan kembali informasi eksplisit dari teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_05', '<p>What is the main purpose of visiting these places: to support conservation or to relax?</p><p>Click Conservation or Relaxation for each place!</p>', null, null, null, null, '[{"key":"conservation","label":"Conservation"},{"key":"relaxation","label":"Relaxation"}]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"A","text":"<p>Munduk Waterfall</p>","correctCategoryKey":"relaxation"},{"id":"B","text":"<p>West Bali National Park</p>","correctCategoryKey":"conservation"},{"id":"C","text":"<p>Tegalalang Rice Terraces</p>","correctCategoryKey":"relaxation"}]'::jsonb, 'Places: A. Relaxation B. Conservation C. Relaxation') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-012', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-10', 'single', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_05', '<p>The text mainly talks about Bali’s …</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>wildlife species and nature lovers</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>unique cultural treasures and sites.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>stunning nature and remarkable sites.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>generations and cultural conservation.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>scenic beauty and local farming practices.</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'C', null, null, null, 'C') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-013', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-04', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-11', 'mcma', 'Evaluasi dan Apresiasi: mampu membuat penilaian terhadap ide, menanggapi teks secara emosional dan estetis dengan mempertimbangkan dampaknya terhadap perasaan, imajinasi, serta penggunaan bahasa oleh', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_05', '<p>Which parts of the text best support the description of Bali as a "Bali is full of natural beauty"?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>A peaceful area filled with green forests, calm mangrove swamps, and colorful coral reefs along the sea.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>These terraces are shaped by generations of farmers who work the land by hand.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Water flows gently over rocky cliffs into a cool, clear pool. Mist rises into the air, mixing with the calming sound of falling water.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>In the morning, mist rises above the fields, and sunlight reflects off the water in the paddies.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Farmers in wide-brimmed hats plant rice carefully, their feet sinking into the soft earth.</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','C','D']::text[], null, null, 'Pernyataan 1, Pernyataan 3, dan Pernyataan 4') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-014', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-12', 'single', 'Pemahaman Tekstual: mampu memahami informasi yang secara eksplisit, mengelompokkan, menyusun ulang, dan menyajikan kembali informasi eksplisit dari teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_06', '<p>During the internship, what did the writer do every morning?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Made schedules and explained them to the coaches.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Played football with the team and got the first aid kit.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Prepared a club gift, guided the coaches, and gave t-shirts.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Woke up early, arrived on time, and followed the instructions.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Set up cones, brought water, and checked emergency schedules.</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'D', null, null, null, 'D') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-015', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-13', 'mcma', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_06', '<p>What are the best words to describe the writer’s personality during the internship?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Careful and ready to help</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Confident and enjoys working alone</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Responsible and willing to learn</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Friendly and works well with others</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Creative and likes to try new things</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','C','D']::text[], null, null, 'Pernyataan 1, Pernyataan 3, dan Pernyataan 4') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-016', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-14', 'single', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_06', '<p>What will the writer most likely do after finishing the internship?</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Considering a career in a sports medicine</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Stop working and focus only on school</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Look for another chance to work in a sports club</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Study medicine to become a doctor</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Train as a professional football player</p>"}]'::jsonb, 'C', null, null, null, 'C') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-017', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-01', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-15', 'mcma', 'Pemahaman Tekstual: mampu memahami informasi yang eksplisit, mengelompokkan, menyusun ulang, dan menyajikan kembali informasi eksplisit dari teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_07', '<p>What will happen if teenagers have poor sleep quality?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Teenagers'' grades could drop.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Teens struggle to focus in class.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Teens are likely to feel stressed.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Teenagers will be more confident</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Teens will become mentally strong.</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','B','C']::text[], null, null, 'A, B, dan C') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-018', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-02', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-16', 'mcma', 'Pemahaman Inferensial: mampu menarik kesimpulan berdasarkan informasi tersirat dalam teks, pengalaman pribadi, serta intuisi untuk memahami isi teks', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_07', '<p>Which of the following additional facts would most likely make the text more persuasive?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Research data showing the number of teenagers experiencing anxiety or depression because of social media.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Personal stories from teenagers who feel happier after reducing their social media use.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Statistics about how many teenagers use social media every day.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>A list of the most popular social media platforms among teenagers.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>Expert opinions from doctors or psychologists about the dangers of social media for mental health.</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','B','E']::text[], null, null, 'A, B, dan E') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-019', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-04', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-17', 'mcma', 'Evaluasi dan Apresiasi: mampu membuat penilaian terhadap ide, menanggapi teks secara emosional dan estetis dengan mempertimbangkan dampaknya terhadap perasaan, imajinasi, serta penggunaan bahasa oleh penulis', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_07', '<p>Which statements from the text support the author’s argument that social media harms teen mental health?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer!</p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>\"When teens see pictures of people who seem perfect, they feel that they are not good enough.\"</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>\"Many teenagers use their phones late at night, which reduces sleep time and quality.\"</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>\"Schools should teach students how to use social media in healthy ways.\"</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>\"Social media helps teens stay connected with friends and learn about interesting topics.\"</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>\"Victims of cyberbullying often feel alone, scared, and helpless.\"</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','B','E']::text[], null, null, 'A, B, dan E') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
insert into public.questions (id, subject_id, topic_id, subtopic_id, type, competency, content_format, passage_id, question_text, explanation, options, correct_answer, correct_answers, categories, statements, source_answer_key) values ('tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-020', 'sub-bahasa-inggris-sma', 'top-bahasa-inggris-sma-04', 'st-bahasa-inggris-sma-18', 'mcma', 'Evaluasi dan Apresiasi: mampu membuat penilaian terhadap ide, menanggapi teks secara emosional dan estetis dengan mempertimbangkan dampaknya terhadap perasaan, imajinasi, serta penggunaan bahasa oleh penulis', 'html', 'psg-tka-bahasa-inggris-sma-bacaan_07', '<p>What is the most prominent impression you gain from the text?</p><p>There is more than one correct answer. Click on every correct answer! </p>', null, '[{"key":"A","text":"<p>Social media makes teenagers unhappy because they compare their lives to unrealistic images online.</p>"},{"key":"B","text":"<p>Teenagers should completely stop using social media to protect their mental health.</p>"},{"key":"C","text":"<p>Using social media too much can disturb teenagers'' sleep and make it harder for them to focus at school.</p>"},{"key":"D","text":"<p>Cyberbullying is a serious problem on social media and can make teenagers feel lonely and scared.</p>"},{"key":"E","text":"<p>The text explains that social media has only negative effects without any positive sides.</p>"}]'::jsonb, null, array['A','C','D']::text[], null, null, 'A, C, dan D') on conflict (id) do update set subject_id = excluded.subject_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, subtopic_id = excluded.subtopic_id, type = excluded.type, competency = excluded.competency, content_format = excluded.content_format, passage_id = excluded.passage_id, question_text = excluded.question_text, options = excluded.options, correct_answer = excluded.correct_answer, correct_answers = excluded.correct_answers, categories = excluded.categories, statements = excluded.statements, source_answer_key = excluded.source_answer_key, updated_at = now();
